.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbweaver 1  "orbweaver 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
orbweaver \- 🕸️  Ecosystem intelligence and leverage engine for ELCI\-group
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbweaver\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
🕸️  Ecosystem intelligence and leverage engine for ELCI\-group
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
orbweaver\-scan(1)
🔍 Discover repositories under a root, extract evidence, and save a snapshot
.TP
orbweaver\-status(1)
📊 Show the most recent snapshot at a glance
.TP
orbweaver\-snapshots(1)
📸 List every snapshot taken so far
.TP
orbweaver\-graph(1)
🕸️  Export the dependency graph of a snapshot
.TP
orbweaver\-capabilities(1)
🧩 List what each repository in a snapshot can actually do
.TP
orbweaver\-duplicates(1)
🔁 Find external dependencies shared by more than one repository — candidates for infrastructure\-extraction review (not proof of duplication; see `orbweaver\-analysis`)
.TP
orbweaver\-interfaces(1)
🔌 List the CLI subcommands detected in a snapshot
.TP
orbweaver\-schemas(1)
📐 List the data schemas detected in a snapshot
.TP
orbweaver\-integrations(1)
🔗 Discover which ELCI tools are actually available and what they actually expose — probes `\-\-help`/`\-\-version` on PATH, never assumes an interface (directive sections 26–27)
.TP
orbweaver\-doctor(1)
🩺 Check that Orbweaver\*(Aqs local environment is healthy
.TP
orbweaver\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
